abstract: |
  Check the coding conventions of a repository with small, neutral,
  parameterised rules:  each rule is a function checking one property of a
  file, and a repository states its conventions by the rules it calls.
authors:
  - alias: kevinmatthes
    family-names: Matthes
    given-names: Kevin
cff-version: 1.2.0
keywords:
  - Rust
  - conventions
  - lint
  - linter
  - prose
  - style
license: GPL-3.0-or-later
message: Please cite this software using these information.
repository-artifact: https://crates.io/crates/coding-conventions
repository-code: https://github.com/kevinmatthes/coding-conventions
title: coding-conventions
url: https://github.com/kevinmatthes/coding-conventions
version: 0.0.0

